@startuml
title B: Gameplay Core（最終調整）

interface IYGInteractionInterface {
  +OnElementReceived(EYGElementType Element, float Strength, AActor* Instigator)
}

class UYGStateComponent
class UYGElementAffinityComponent
class UYGInteractionResponseComponent
class UYGRespawnComponent

IYGInteractionInterface <|.. UYGInteractionResponseComponent
UYGInteractionResponseComponent --> UYGStateComponent
UYGInteractionResponseComponent --> UYGElementAffinityComponent

note bottom
属性入力は Interface 経由で統一。
状態の真値は StateComponent に集約。
end note

@enduml
